/******************
	MAIN ESTIMATION OPTIONS

	1 - Panel FE DiD
	2 - Basic ES model
	3 - ES w/ unit trends
	4 - ES with pre-trends; Idea #1
	5 - ES with pre-trends; Idea #2
	6 - ES with pooled event times
	7 - ES with dropped end-points

